sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (CLI)
    participant G as AXME Gateway
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant E as Email Delivery
    participant S as Secret Store<br/>(keyring / file 0600)

    Note over U,S: Email OTP Login Flow (axme login)

    U->>G: POST /v1/auth/login-intent<br/>{ email } + x-api-key
    G->>A: create login intent + generate OTP
    A->>E: dispatch email (OTP + magic link, TTL 5 min)
    G-->>U: { intent_id, expires_in: 300 }

    U->>U: user reads OTP from email

    U->>G: POST /v1/auth/login-intent/{id}/verify<br/>{ code: "123456" } + x-api-key
    G->>A: validate OTP hash (single-use)
    A->>A: find-or-create account by email<br/>issue JWT + refresh_token
    G->>G: auto-provision org + workspace<br/>apply email_verified quota
    G->>G: create managed service-account + api_key
    G-->>U: { ok, api_key, account_session_token,<br/>refresh_token, org_id, workspace_id }

    U->>S: store { api_key, account_session_token,<br/>refresh_token } securely

    Note over U,S: Normal CLI operation (access_token TTL = 15 min)

    U->>U: before each request:<br/>check JWT exp − now
    alt exp − now < 60s (proactive refresh)
        U->>G: POST /v1/auth/refresh<br/>{ refresh_token } + x-api-key
        G->>A: validate refresh_token (one-time-use)
        A->>A: rotate: issue new access_token<br/>+ new refresh_token, invalidate old
        G-->>U: { access_token, refresh_token,<br/>expires_in: 900, refresh_expires_in: 2592000 }
        U->>S: persist new tokens
    end

    U->>G: API request + Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
    G-->>U: response

    Note over U,S: Refresh token expires after 30 days of inactivity → re-login via OTP
